# The only variable the frontend reads. No secret belongs in here: everything under
# VITE_ is inlined into the bundle and shipped to every visitor.
#
# Unset  -> http://localhost:8787, which is right on a laptop and impossible from a
#           deployed preview. On an https page the app detects that, stops polling
#           entirely and says so on screen instead of hammering an address nobody
#           is listening on. See API_UNREACHABLE in src/lib/api.ts.
# Set    -> must be https on a deployed preview, or the browser blocks it as mixed
#           content before the request leaves the tab.
VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api.example.com
